 of Thought Empowers Transformers to Solve Inherently Serial Problems</title>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><forename type=\"first\">Zhiyuan</forename><surname>Li</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t\t<idno type=\"DOI\">10.48550/arXiv.2402.12875</idno>\n\t\t<idno type=\"arXiv\">arXiv:2402.12875</idno>\n\t\t<imprint>\n\t\t\t<date type=\"published\" when=\"2024-09\">Sept. 2024</date>\n\t\t</imprint>\n\t</monogr>\n\t<note>cs, stat</note>\n</biblStruct>\n\n<biblStruct status=\"extracted\" xml:id=\"b16\">\n\t<monogr>\n\t\t<title level=\"m\" type=\"main\">Let&apos;s Verify Step by Step</title>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><surname>Hunter Lightman</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t\t<idno type=\"arXiv\">arXiv:2305.20050</idno>\n\t\t<imprint>\n\t\t\t<date type=\"published\" when=\"2023-05\">May 2023</date>\n\t\t</imprint>\n\t</monogr>\n\t<note>cs</note>\n</biblStruct>\n\n<biblStruct status=\"extracted\" xml:id=\"b17\">\n\t<monogr>\n\t\t<title level=\"m\" type=\"main\">Improve Mathematical Reasoning in Language Models by Automated Process Supervision</title>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><forename type=\"first\">Liangchen</forename><surname>Luo</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t\t<idno type=\"arXiv\">arXiv:2406.06592</idno>\n\t\t<imprint>\n\t\t\t<date type=\"published\" when=\"2024-06\">June 2024</date>\n\t\t</imprint>\n\t</monogr>\n\t<note>cs</note>\n</biblStruct>\n\n<biblStruct status=\"extracted\" xml:id=\"b18\">\n\t<monogr>\n\t\t<title level=\"m\" type=\"main\">Self-Refine: Iterative Refinement with Self-Feedback</title>\n\t\t<author>\n\t\t\t<persName><forename type=\"first\">Aman</forename><surname>Madaan</surname></persName>\n\t\t</author>\n\t\t<idno type=\"DOI\">10.48550/arXiv.2303.17651</idno>\n\t\t<idno type=\"arXiv\">arXiv:2303.17651</idno>\n\t\t<imprint>\n\t\t\t<date type=\"published\" when=\"2023-05\">May 2023</date>\n\t\t</imprint>\n\t</monogr>\n\t<note>cs</note>\n</biblStruct>\n\n<biblStruct status=\"extracted\" xml:id=\"b19\">\n\t<monogr>\n\t\